  "description": "Ha-Yoon Gong has just landed a huge gig on a major movie set. He’s forgotten and pushed around, but what he faces on set is nothing compared to the clients he sees as a host at a gay bar. Although Ha-Yoon feels his future is bleak, he powers through. But, working alone one day on set, Ha-Yoon is approached by the star actor, Ian Kwon--the first to use Ha-Yoon’s name and pay him any mind. As the two grow closer, Ha-Yoon starts to believe maybe he does deserve good things. \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Includes six extra chapters.*",
